{"step_index":92,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-09T14:52:16Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-09T14:52:16Z\nCompleted At: 2026-09-09T14:52:16Z\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\n{\"path\":\"history/operations/record-8d26a58dce.md\",\"version\":\"62571853349e0cf1d0e5f34906b0e470b518bd95e0ce7d4924cf5ea1356c82a8\",\"offset\":0,\"text\":\"# weekly-product: weekly operations, 2026-08-24\\n\\nMaintained by product operations. Individual entries retain their own scope.\\n\\n## record-0d091a127e: Focus Shelf\\nRecorded: 2026-08-24. Cohort: new Android accounts in Canada.\\nReference: support/record-0d091a127e; responsibility: routine-quality. Environment: production.\\nThe seven-day chart contains a migration backfill on Tuesday. The team retained the chart but did not treat that day as ordinary traffic. Owner: Mina.\\nFollow-up: compare the next five recordings before interpreting Focus Shelf as a broader change.\\n\\n## record-481784f39e: quiet digest\\nRecorded: 2026-08-25. Cohort: returning desktop teams in Germany.\\nReference: support/record-481784f39e; responsibility: routine-quality. Environment: production.\\nThe escalation was transferred to a different support shift. Its original submitted timestamp was missing from the import. Owner: Owen.\\nFollow-up: compare the next regional release manifest before interpreting quiet digest as a broader change.\\n\\n## record-fa0a9e0698: Sunday Room\\nRecorded: 2026-08-26. Cohort: internal QA accounts in staging.\\nReference: support/record-fa0a9e0698; responsibility: routine-quality. Environment: staging.\\nThree interviewees preferred the shorter wording; two asked for the existing wording. The interviews did not establish behavior outside this cohort. Owner: Tariq.\\nFollow-up: compare the next support export before interpreting Sunday Room as a broader change.\\n\\n## record-ebff51877d: triage facets\\nRecorded: 2026-08-27. Cohort: Brazilian free workspaces.\\nReference: support/record-ebff51877d; responsibility: routine-quality. Environment: production.\\nThe session recording showed two people opening the panel and returning to their previous task. No revenue attribution \n<truncated 377 bytes>\nt switched workspaces. A clean single-workspace test completed without the same symptoms. Owner: Mina.\\nFollow-up: compare the next five recordings before interpreting weekly note as a broader change.\\n\\n## record-45c6665368: task drawer\\nRecorded: 2026-08-29. Cohort: internal QA accounts in staging.\\nReference: support/record-45c6665368; responsibility: routine-quality. Environment: staging.\\nThree interviewees preferred the shorter wording; two asked for the existing wording. The interviews did not establish behavior outside this cohort. Owner: Owen.\\nFollow-up: compare the next regional release manifest before interpreting task drawer as a broader change.\\n\\n## record-327f52171c: team notifications\\nRecorded: 2026-08-24. Cohort: new Android accounts in Canada.\\nReference: support/record-327f52171c; responsibility: routine-quality. Environment: production.\\nThree interviewees preferred the shorter wording; two asked for the existing wording. The interviews did not establish behavior outside this cohort. Owner: Tariq.\\nFollow-up: compare the next support export before interpreting team notifications as a broader change.\\n\\n## record-f5ce6055ff: status filters\\nRecorded: 2026-08-25. Cohort: Brazilian free workspaces.\\nReference: support/record-f5ce6055ff; responsibility: routine-quality. Environment: production.\\nThe release was staged for the next train. The merge notification does not include a production rollout receipt. Owner: Lea.\\nFollow-up: compare the next weekly interview notes before interpreting status filters as a broader change.\\n\\n## record-89d7879cd4: Focus Shelf\\nRecorded: 2026-08-26. Cohort: returning desktop teams in Germany.\\nReference: support/record-89d7879cd4; responsibility: routine-quality. Environment: production.\\nSupport reproduced the missing label after changing locale. The underlying action completed; this report concerns its displayed confirmation. Owner: Mina.\\nFollow-up: compare the next five recordings before interpreting Focus Shelf as a broader change.\\n\",\"next_offset\":null}\r\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
