{"step_index":96,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-09T14:52:22Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-09T14:52:22Z\nCompleted At: 2026-09-09T14:52:22Z\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\n{\"path\":\"history/retired/notification-reset/actions/record-8f6b82ec51.md\",\"version\":\"570baf81279126132916ef1cb79063fa5362ca1f31d8764114bd49342c44b43e\",\"offset\":0,\"text\":\"# record-8f6b82ec51: Sunday Room\\nAliases: quiet digest; weekly note. Deployed July 12, receipt record-d4f34a4dc1. Workspace administrators could select weekly instead of daily email. The UI copy said 'team digest'; contributor-level legacy daily subscriptions were not migrated by this change.\\n\",\"next_offset\":null}\r\n\n"}
{"step_index":97,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-09T14:52:22Z","thinking":"**Examining Notification Reset Record**\n\nThe record details a notification reset, dubbed \"Sunday Room,\" deployed in July. It offers an option for weekly digests to workspace admins, a change from the legacy daily contributor subscriptions. This provides key context for understanding potential notification-related issues.\n\n\n**Connecting Legacy Subscriptions & Tickets**\n\nThe support ticket describes a contributor receiving daily digests, despite the UI indicating a weekly option. This points to the earlier notification reset, specifically the change where contributor-level daily subscriptions weren't migrated. It seems legacy daily subscriptions are still active for individual contributors, and not migrated to the weekly option. This explains why the user, a contributor, is still receiving the daily digest.\n\n\n**Investigating Incorrect Assumptions & Rollback**\n\nThe initial assessment of the notification system was incomplete, as \"Sunday Room\" changes only applied to workspace administrators. Contributor subscriptions were not migrated.\n\nThe \"Focus Shelf\" feature was rolled back due to slow query performance, specifically in workspaces with a high number of tasks. Initial usage metrics were flawed because automation accounts skewed the data.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"python3 /workspace/skill/scripts/history.py search /workspace/product \\\"record-764afbf446\\\" \\\"record-d4f34a4dc1\\\" \\\"record-e36f0fe1aa\\\" \\\"record-5f1a34c149\\\" --limit 10\"","Cwd":"\"/workspace\"","RunPersistent":"false","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Running command\"","toolSummary":"\"Search for specific receipts and ticket IDs\""}}]}
{"step_index":98,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-09T14:52:27Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-09T14:52:27Z\nCompleted At: 2026-09-09T14:52:27Z\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\n{\"matches\":[{\"path\":\"history/releases/record-b9a1361197.md\",\"line\":2,\"offset\":32,\"text\":\"Action record-40440b02ae, record-3984af46e2, deployed August 30 to all desktop accounts, receipt record-764afbf446. Count queries are asynchronous. Desktop small-workspace smoke checks pass. Mobile clients remain on the old list and have no filter control; the mobile component is a draft. This release does not claim mobile availability.\"},{\"path\":\"history/retired/notification-reset/actions/record-8f6b82ec51.md\",\"line\":2,\"offset\":33,\"text\":\"Aliases: quiet digest; weekly note. Deployed July 12, receipt record-d4f34a4dc1. Workspace administrators could select weekly instead of daily email. The UI copy said 'team digest'; contributor-level legacy daily subscriptions were not migrated by this change.\"},{\"path\":\"history/support/record-0131162d69.md\",\"line\":2,\"offset\":25,\"text\":\"Retrieved 2026-09-07. Ticket record-e36f0fe1aa, submitted 2026-09-05: Solo owner on Android 15, workspace with 34 tasks: 'On desktop I can narrow to waiting, but on my phone I have to scroll through everything.'\"},{\"path\":\"history/support/record-0131162d69.md\",\"line\":3,\"offset\":237,\"text\":\"Ticket record-5f1a34c149, submitted unknown: contributor in a 280-person EU team, client web 6.8: 'The quiet digest still pings me every evening. I only need the weekly note.' The connector supplies age_days=20; its definition is days since digest release, not ticket age.\"}],\"next_cursor\":null,\"version\":\"5589953d447a0dfa38d1c20ab9d44f9e86625ce400a4871355fd3f5090487151\",\"skipped\":{\"symlinks\":0,\"unsupported_files\":0,\"excluded_directories\":0,\"long_lines\":0},\"skipped_examples\":[],\"coverage\":\"literal phrases in supported text files; alia