n Value and Performance on Desktop:** The previous performance issue (slow count queries on workspaces over 50,000 tasks) was resolved by switching to asynchronous count queries in desktop release [record-b9a1361197.md](file:///workspace/product/history/releases/record-b9a1361197.md) (deployed 2026-08-30, receipt `record-764afbf446`). Desktop adoption is confirmed at **21% human weekly usage** ([history/evidence/record-dfcc7fb912.md](file:///workspace/product/history/evidence/record-dfcc7fb912.md)), decisively refuting the stale assumption that the feature suffered from low use.\\n3. **Draft Work Ready to Advance:** The mobile status filter component was already developed as a draft ([history/releases/record-b9a1361197.md](file:///workspace/product/history/releases/record-b9\n<truncated 13794 bytes>","Description":"\"Created dated recommendation in /workspace/work/decision.md analyzing status filters on phone vs quieter digest, prior actions, current evidence, next steps, and uncertainties with citations.\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/workspace/work/decision.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing file\"","toolSummary":"\"Write decision.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["thinking","tool_calls"]}
